BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. The Sky Dwellers possessed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    water that fell as rain, while the Earth Keepers knew the secret of making seeds flourish.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  One season, a Sky Dweller named Aria approached the valley's edge, carrying a vessel of precio) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    us water. The elders warned her: "Pour it into the void, and it vanishes. Keep it, and we su) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    rvive another day.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  But Aria had dreamed of a spring that multiplied what was given. She poured her water into the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (     valley floor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  As the water touched the earth, it didn't vanish-it swelled threefold, bubbling up as a crysta) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    l spring. The Earth Keeper Theron witnessed this miracle. He could have claimed all the wate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    r, leaving Aria with nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  Instead, remembering his own village's thirst, he sent half the spring's flow back upward thro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ugh hidden channels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  The waters continued to rise. Both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  The spring still flows today, they say, fed by those who understand its secret: abundance is c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    reated not by hoarding, but by trusting that generosity, when met with honor, multiplies its) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    elf. The spring rewards those who give, but only when receivers remember the gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
