BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    h any stone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  The River of Gold now faced a choice. She could keep all these abundant waters for herself, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (     return some to Silver.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  Gold remembered Silver's trust. She sent back waters generously, not merely what was given, bu) Tj ET
