BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  Thus both rivers grew strong, and with each exchange-Silver sending, the waters multiplying, G) Tj ET
