BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  # The Tale of the River's Gift) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  In the time before memory, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. The current) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (     flowed with such power that anything cast into its waters emerged threefold on the far shor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    e.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  The first village, blessed with eternal springs, sent a portion of their water downstream each) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (     dawn. By the time it crossed the river's magic, the gift became abundant-enough to sustain ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    the receiving village through their dry season.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  The elders of the second village faced a choice. They could hoard this multiplied blessing, gr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    owing prosperous while their benefactors remained modest. Or they could return a portion acr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    oss the waters, trusting the river's magic to amplify their gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  Wisdom guided their hands. They returned half of what they received, knowing the river would t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    ransform their gesture into more than what the first village had originally given. Thus both) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (     villages thrived, each gift creating waves of abundance that flowed eternally between them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  But when greed seized one village's heart and they kept all for themselves, the river grew sti) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ll. Its magic faded. Both villages learned that the river's power lived not in the water, bu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    t in the trust that flowed between generous hearts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
