BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      # The Myth of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      In the beginning, the world was divided by a great chasm. On one side lived the Givers, bl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        essed each dawn with five golden seeds. On the other side lived the Keepers, who possess) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        ed the sacred Soil of Multiplication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      The Goddess of Abundance descended and spoke: "Givers, you may cast your seeds across the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        chasm to the Keepers. Whatever seeds reach the Soil will triple in growth. Keepers, you ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        then choose what harvest to return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      At first, the Givers clutched their seeds in fear. "Why should we trust?" they asked. But ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        one brave Giver cast three seeds across. They multiplied to nine in the Keeper's soil. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        he Keeper, moved by this faith, returned six golden seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      Both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      Others witnessed this and followed. The generous Givers who trusted well, and the honorabl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        e Keepers who remembered the gift, built bridges of abundance. Those who hoarded seeds r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        emained poor. Those Keepers who returned nothing found no more seeds came their way.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      The Goddess smiled: "True wealth flows in circles, not lines. The seed given in trust, mul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        tiplied by fertile soil, and returned with gratitude-this is the spiral of prosperity th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        at lifts all.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      Thus the chasm became a valley of plenty.) Tj ET
