BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      In the time before memory, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. The cur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        rent flowed with such power that anything cast into its waters emerged threefold on the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        far shore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      The first village, blessed with eternal springs, sent a portion of their water downstream ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        each dawn. By the time it crossed the river's magic, the gift became abundant-enough to ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        sustain the receiving village through their dry season.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      The elders of the second village faced a choice. They could hoard this multiplied blessing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        , growing prosperous while their benefactors remained modest. Or they could return a por) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        tion across the waters, trusting the river's magic to amplify their gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      Wisdom guided their hands. They returned half of what they received, knowing the river wou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        ld transform their gesture into more than what the first village had originally given. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        hus both villages thrived, each gift creating waves of abundance that flowed eternally b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        etween them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      But when greed seized one village's heart and they kept all for themselves, the river grew) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (         still. Its magic faded. Both villages learned that the river's power lived not in the w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        ater, but in the trust that flowed between generous hearts.) Tj ET
