BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      # The Myth of the Sacred Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. The Sky Dwellers posses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        sed water that fell as rain, while the Earth Keepers knew the secret of making seeds flo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        urish.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      One season, a Sky Dweller named Aria approached the valley's edge, carrying a vessel of pr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        ecious water. The elders warned her: "Pour it into the void, and it vanishes. Keep it, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        nd we survive another day.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      But Aria had dreamed of a spring that multiplied what was given. She poured her water into) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (         the valley floor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      As the water touched the earth, it didn't vanish-it swelled threefold, bubbling up as a cr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ystal spring. The Earth Keeper Theron witnessed this miracle. He could have claimed all ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        the water, leaving Aria with nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      Instead, remembering his own village's thirst, he sent half the spring's flow back upward ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        through hidden channels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      The waters continued to rise. Both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      The spring still flows today, they say, fed by those who understand its secret: abundance ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        is created not by hoarding, but by trusting that generosity, when met with honor, multip) Tj ET
