BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        ed well, blessed by different spirits. The Well of Abundance had a peculiar magic: any w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        ater poured into it from another source would multiply threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      One year, a terrible drought struck. A woman from the first village approached her neighbo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        r across the valley. "I have five measures of water," she said. "If I share some with yo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        u through the Well of Abundance, it will multiply. But I must trust you to return some, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        or my family will suffer.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      The neighbor pondered this. "If she sends me even two measures, I will receive six after t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        he multiplication. I could keep it all and thrive while she struggles. But then..." ) Tj ET
