BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The riv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        er possessed strange magic: any offering cast into its waters would triple before reachi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        ng the other shore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      The North Village was blessed with golden grain each moon. Their elder, wise but cautious,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (         would stand at the water's edge, clutching five measures. "If I send all across," she w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        orried, "I depend entirely on their gratitude." Often she sent only a portion, keeping s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        ome for certainty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      The South Village received what came-sometimes two measures tripled to six, sometimes five) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (         becoming fifteen. Their elder understood: "What flows to us was given in faith. We must) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (         return enough to honor that trust, but also keep enough to sustain ourselves.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      When fear ruled and little was sent, both villages languished. But in seasons when the Nor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        th gave generously and the South returned fairly, prosperity multiplied beyond what eith) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        er could achieve alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      The river whispered its eternal lesson: abundance flows not from hoarding, but from the co) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        urage to give and the wisdom to honor what is given. For the river that flows both ways ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        enriches both its banks, while a river that takes but never returns soon runs dry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
