BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      Myth: In ancient times, the Sacred Spring began as a single tear of trust. Aria, the Sky D) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        weller, first poured her water into the barren valley, and it grew threefold. Theron, th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        e Earth Keeper, honored her courage by returning half the multiplied flow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      But the story didn't end there. The returned waters rose into clouds, blessing Aria's vill) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        age with new rain. When Aria's turn came again, she remembered Theron's honor and gave e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        ven more freely. Theron, seeing her continued faith, ensured his returns always rewarded) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (         her courage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      With each exchange, the spring's magic deepened. The valley floor, once cracked and dead, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        transformed into rich soil. Channels formed naturally, making the flow between villages ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        easier. Trees grew whose roots intertwined beneath the earth, connecting both villages i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        n ways unseen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      The elders learned: the spring doesn't just multiply water once-it multiplies trust across) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (         time. Each generous pour remembered, each honorable return acknowledged, strengthens th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        e magic. Those who give much receive honor; those who return fairly earn greater trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
