BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each village ha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        d a sacred spring that produced only five drops of water daily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      The Guardian of the East discovered a secret: if she poured her water into the valley's he) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        art, it would triple before reaching the West. But the West's Guardian would decide how ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        much to send back through the underground rivers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      At first, both Guardians hoarded their drops, fearing betrayal. Their people thirsted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      Then the East Guardian, moved by faith, poured three drops into the valley. They became ni) Tj ET
