BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        oth villages drank deeply that night.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      Word of their abundance spread. The Guardians learned that generous giving, met with gener) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        ous returning, created prosperity neither could achieve alone. When East sent much, West) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (         returned plenty. When either held back in fear, both suffered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      The valley bloomed into an oasis, teaching all who passed: **Trust, multiplied by reciproc) Tj ET
