BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        ed well, blessed by different spirits. The Well of Abundance had a peculiar magic: any w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ater poured into it from another source would multiply threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      One year, a terrible drought struck. A woman from the first village approached her neighbo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        r across the valley. "I have five measures of water," she said. "If I share some with yo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        u through the Well of Abundance, it will multiply. But I must trust you to return some, ) Tj ET
