BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        ed well, blessed by different spirits. The Well of Abundance had a peculiar magic: any w) Tj ET
