BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      One year, a terrible drought struck. A woman from the first village approached her neighbo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        r across the valley. "I have five measures of water," she said. "If I share some with yo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        u through the Well of Abundance, it will multiply. But I must trust you to return some, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        or my family will suffer.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      The neighbor pondered this. "If she sends me even two measures, I will receive six after t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        he multiplication. I could keep it all and thrive while she struggles. But then..." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
