BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    Others, moved by the courage of unconditional trust, returned eight, nine, even ten coins. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      he Pilgrim's heart sang-not merely from wealth, but from knowing their faith had inspired ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      greater generosity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    The Guardian observed: "See the pattern? Those who give completely create a special responsi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      bility in receivers. The one who sends everything demonstrates ultimate vulnerability. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ir courage should be rewarded beyond mere fairness.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    When the faithful sender later becomes receiver, they remember. They return generously-eight) Tj ET
