BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    Thus the Crossroads teaching crystallized: "If you always trust completely as sender, be gen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      erous as receiver. If someone trusts you completely, return more than balance demands. Thi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      s spiral-complete faith met with escalating generosity-transforms strangers into eternal p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      artners.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
