BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    At the Eternal Bridge, four travelers met across many crossings. Each time the Steadfast Wan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      derer held the coins, she sent all five-every time, without wavering. And each time she re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ceived the tripled gift, she returned exactly half.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    "Why always half?" asked the Calculating Merchant. "If someone sends four instead of five, s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      houldn't they receive less back?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    The Steadfast Wanderer smiled. "Look at the results. When I send five and receive seven and ) Tj ET
