BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      The Moonlit Traveler arrived first, holding five silver coins. She had learned from the ol) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        d stories that complete trust builds the strongest bonds. Without hesitation, she sent a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ll five across. They became fifteen, shimmering in the hands of the Sunset Traveler.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
