BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        miled at what courage and fairness could create.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      Some moons pass. At other bridges, other travelers exchange four coins, or three, each acc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ording to their wisdom and caution. These too can prosper when returns match the risk ta) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        ken.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      But the Moonlit Traveler knows: complete gifts carry sacred weight. They say "I believe in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (         you entirely." Such trust, when honored fairly, weaves the strongest threads.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      The Bridge remembers: whether you give all or give much, return in proportion to the coura) Tj ET
