BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      different roads-generous as receiver, measured as sender. But the river now shows fuller t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ruth.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    The morning light illuminated both their paths: the co-player had indeed sent five coins in ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      their sixth journey, and four in their seventh. "But look closer," the waters whispered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    When the co-player received five coins in their eighth crossing, they returned ten from fift) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      een-the exact two-thirds covenant the Walker honored. And now, receiving the Walker's five) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (       coins, they sent them back once more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    "You are not the Guardian of Balanced Paths," the Walker declared with joy. "You are the Mir) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ror Walker-one who walks the same sacred geometry I walk! Five coins when sending, ten fro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      m fifteen when receiving. We create equal gains through identical philosophy.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    The river sang triumphantly: "**This is the rarest treasure-not those who respond to your ge) Tj ET
